 "verdict": "The panels differ materially and the replay panel is a strict subset, so the necessary condition for the cs_max mechanism holds. But the SIZE of the composition gap does not track the day-to-day swing: pearson(gap, spearman_464) = -0.288, and 2022-07-29 has the second-largest gap with the second-BEST rank correlation. Composition difference permits the mechanism; it does not by itself explain the magnitude or the swing.",
